1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,340
In my family,

2
00:00:01,390 --> 00:00:04,289
we bury our dead with a stone in their mouth.

3
00:00:04,359 --> 00:00:05,289
When I was eight,

4
00:00:05,339 --> 00:00:07,591
I watched Gran do it to Grandad.

5
00:00:07,641 --> 00:00:08,236
She said,

6
00:00:08,286 --> 00:00:10,067
the dead wake up hungry.

7
00:00:10,117 --> 00:00:11,387
They chew their shroud.

8
00:00:11,437 --> 00:00:12,942
Thread by thread.

9
00:00:12,992 --> 00:00:14,042
And while they chew...

10
00:00:14,092 --> 00:00:15,367
the family dies.

11
00:00:15,417 --> 00:00:16,782
One by one.

12
00:00:17,172 --> 00:00:19,215
Gran's been gone for years.

13
00:00:19,265 --> 00:00:20,075
Last month,

14
00:00:20,125 --> 00:00:22,567
there was another funeral in our family.

15
00:00:22,617 --> 00:00:23,112
Small.

16
00:00:23,162 --> 00:00:23,797
Rainy.

17
00:00:23,847 --> 00:00:26,460
Mum doesn't believe in the old ways.

18
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:27,979
There was no stone.

19
00:00:28,449 --> 00:00:29,339
A week later,

20
00:00:29,389 --> 00:00:31,467
my uncle died in his sleep.

21
00:00:31,537 --> 00:00:32,988
Then my aunt.

22
00:00:33,098 --> 00:00:34,508
I've been so tired.

23
00:00:34,558 --> 00:00:36,180
I can't seem to get up.

24
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:37,705
Tonight,

25
00:00:37,755 --> 00:00:38,725
I woke at three.

26
00:00:38,775 --> 00:00:39,217
My jaw ached.

27
00:00:39,287 --> 00:00:40,447
Something was chewing.

28
00:00:40,497 --> 00:00:41,142
Slow.

29
00:00:41,192 --> 00:00:42,130
Close.

30
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:45,322
I told myself it was coming from the grave.

31
00:00:45,552 --> 00:00:47,866
Then I felt thread between my teeth.

32
00:00:48,016 --> 00:00:49,833
I turned on the torch.

33
00:00:49,883 --> 00:00:50,848
White satin.

34
00:00:50,898 --> 00:00:53,087
Six inches above my face.

35
00:00:53,318 --> 00:00:55,069
It was my funeral.

36
00:00:55,699 --> 00:00:57,435
Mum's texted again.

37
00:00:57,485 --> 00:00:59,397
She's the last one left.

38
00:00:59,707 --> 00:01:01,048
Still hungry.
